  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Consortium for Sudan (CCS) - FY2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cash Consortium of Sudan (CCS), led by Mercy Corps, has developed the below proposal to support the continued delivery of life-saving humanitarian assistance through an effective, efficient, and people-centred response to the complex emergency in Sudan. The proposal outlines in detail CCS&#x2019;s strategy for FCDO FY2026&#x2013;27 and aims to reach at least 1 million individuals across the most affected states, including conflict-affected areas and displacement and return hotspots, with a particular focus on locations classified as IPC Phase 4 and 5. In addition, CCS presents its vision for a potential multi-year strategy and a longer-term approach to linking humanitarian assistance with early recovery efforts in line with needs of must-vulnerable communities.</narrative>
  </description>
